    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d4">

                <pb facs="0040" n="4" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v06/pg4"/>

                <head>4. National Security Study Memorandum 1<anchor n="1" xml:id="d4-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1969-01-21">January 21, 1969</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list type="to">
                    <head>TO</head>
                    <item>The Secretary of State</item>
                    <item>The Secretary of Defense</item>
                    <item>The Director of Central Intelligence</item>
                </list>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Situation in Vietnam</item>
                </list>
                <pb facs="0041" n="5" xml:id="pg5"/>
                <p>In an effort to develop an agreed evaluation of the situation in Vietnam as a
                    basis for making policy decisions, the President has directed that each
                    addressee of this memorandum, the U.S. Ambassador in Saigon, the Joint Chiefs of
                    Staff, and MACV prepare a separate response to the attached questions. The
                    answers should include a discussion of uncertainties and possible alternative
                    interpretations of existing data.</p>
                <p>The President wishes to receive, as well, the Secretary of State’s comments on
                    the Ambassador’s response, and the comments of the Secretary of Defense on the
                    responses of the Joint Chiefs of Staff and MACV.</p>
                <p>All replies should be forwarded to the President by February 10, 1969.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Henry A. Kissinger</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d4-a1.xml" xpointer="d4-a1"/>
            </div>
